{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "$id": "interactive_object.schema.json",
  "title": "Objet interactif du monde (décor, coffre, station de craft...)",
  "$comment": "Nommé 'interactive_object' pour ne pas le confondre avec item.schema.json (objet d'inventaire). Ce fichier décrit un élément de décor avec lequel on interagit (fouiller, crafter, examiner), pas un objet qu'on transporte.",
  "$defs": {
    "interaction": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "type": {
          "type": "string",
          "enum": ["fouille", "craft", "examiner"]
        },
        "label": { "type": "string", "minLength": 1 },
        "requires_items": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": { "$ref": "common.schema.json#/$defs/item_stack" },
          "description": "Peut être vide si aucun item requis."
        },
        "consumes_items": { "type": "boolean" },
        "loot_table": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "additionalProperties": false,
            "properties": {
              "item": { "$ref": "common.schema.json#/$defs/slug" },
              "quantity": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 1 },
              "probability": { "$ref": "common.schema.json#/$defs/probability" }
            },
            "required": ["item", "quantity", "probability"]
          }
        },
        "success_probability": { "$ref": "common.schema.json#/$defs/probability" },
        "success_text": { "type": "string", "minLength": 1 },
        "fail_text": { "type": "string", "minLength": 1 },
        "cooldown": { "type": "string" }
      },
      "required": [
        "type", "label", "requires_items", "consumes_items", "loot_table",
        "success_probability", "success_text", "fail_text", "cooldown"
      ],
      "if": {
        "properties": { "type": { "enum": ["fouille", "craft"] } },
        "required": ["type"]
      },
      "then": {
        "properties": {
          "loot_table": { "minItems": 1 }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "type": "object",
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "properties": {
    "name": { "type": "string", "minLength": 1 },
    "description": { "type": "string", "minLength": 1 },
    "asset": { "$ref": "common.schema.json#/$defs/asset_path" },
    "locations": {
      "type": "array",
      "minItems": 1,
      "items": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
          "place": { "$ref": "common.schema.json#/$defs/slug" },
          "sous_zone": { "type": "string" },
          "probability": { "$ref": "common.schema.json#/$defs/probability" }
        },
        "required": ["place", "sous_zone", "probability"]
      }
    },
    "reusable": { "type": "boolean" },
    "respawn": {
      "oneOf": [
        { "type": "boolean" },
        { "type": "string", "enum": ["jamais", "partie_suivante"] }
      ],
      "$comment": "Incohérence détectée dans ton template : la valeur par défaut est 'false' (booléen) mais le commentaire décrit des valeurs texte ('jamais', 'partie_suivante'). J'ai autorisé les deux et ajouté la règle if/then ci-dessous ; à toi de trancher définitivement."
    },
    "interactions": {
      "type": "array",
      "minItems": 1,
      "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/interaction" }
    }
  },
  "required": ["name", "description", "asset", "locations", "reusable", "respawn", "interactions"],
  "if": {
    "properties": { "reusable": { "const": false } },
    "required": ["reusable"]
  },
  "then": {
    "properties": {
      "respawn": { "type": "string", "enum": ["jamais", "partie_suivante"] }
    }
  },
  "else": {
    "properties": {
      "respawn": { "type": "boolean" }
    }
  }
}